    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d309-a7">

                <pb facs="0512" n="442" sameAs="frus:frus1867p2/pg442"/>

                <head>M. Curtopassi to Mr. Otterbourg</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Legation of Italy,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Mexico,</hi>
                        </placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1867-07-17"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >July</hi> 17, 1867</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Consul:</hi> My intention is to quit Mexico in a
                    few days and to travel towards the Gulf, to embark at Vera Cruz.</p>
                <p>I do not know what formalities are to be observed, and, as I have no relations
                    with the Mexican authorities, I take the liberty to ask your friendly
                    intervention to enable me to effect my purpose as soon as possible.</p>
                <p>Accept my thanks in advance, with the assurance of my distinguished
                    consideration.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>TH. CURTOPASSI, <hi rendition="#italic">Chargé d’ Affaires of
                            Italy.</hi></signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Marcus Otterbourg,</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">United States Consul in Mexico.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
